Chapter: MqttSn
  cites Foreword chapter CCE (to-unicode)

 MQTT-SN v1.2, the MQTT variant for wireless sensor networks -- UDP or
 non-IP bearers (802.15.4, ZigBee, BLE) where the full TCP-based MQTT
 is too heavy. Every message begins with a length field (one byte when
 the total is under 256, otherwise 0x01 followed by a two-byte length)
 and a message type. Two-byte fields (topic id, message id, duration)
 are big-endian. Each builder returns a List Integer.

Section: Message Types

  mqttsn-advertise : Integer = #00
  mqttsn-searchgw : Integer = #01
  mqttsn-gwinfo : Integer = #02
  mqttsn-connect : Integer = #04
  mqttsn-connack : Integer = #05
  mqttsn-register : Integer = #0A
  mqttsn-regack : Integer = #0B
  mqttsn-publish : Integer = #0C
  mqttsn-puback : Integer = #0D
  mqttsn-subscribe : Integer = #12
  mqttsn-suback : Integer = #13
  mqttsn-unsubscribe : Integer = #14
  mqttsn-pingreq : Integer = #16
  mqttsn-pingresp : Integer = #17
  mqttsn-disconnect : Integer = #18

Section: Flags

 The flags octet: DUP (bit 7), QoS (bits 6-5), Retain (bit 4), Will
 (bit 3), CleanSession (bit 2), TopicIdType (bits 1-0).

  mqttsn-flag-clean-session : Integer = #04
  mqttsn-flag-will : Integer = #08
  mqttsn-flag-retain : Integer = #10
  mqttsn-flag-dup : Integer = #80
  mqttsn-protocol-id : Integer = #01

Section: Helpers

  mqttsn-u16 : Integer -> List Integer
  mqttsn-u16 (v) = [bit-and (bit-shru v 8) 255, bit-and v 255]

  mqttsn-text-bytes : Text -> List Integer
  mqttsn-text-bytes (s) = mqttsn-text-loop s 0 (text-length s) []

  mqttsn-text-loop : Text, Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  mqttsn-text-loop (s) (i) (len) (acc) =
   if i >= len then acc
   else mqttsn-text-loop s (i + 1) len (list-push acc (to-unicode (char-code (char-at s i))))

 Prepend the length and message-type octets. The length counts itself:
 one byte when the total fits, otherwise the three-byte escaped form.

  mqttsn-frame : Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  mqttsn-frame (msg-type) (rest) =
   let body = [msg-type] & rest
   in let short-total = 1 + list-length body
   in if short-total < 256 then [short-total] & body
   else [1, bit-and (bit-shru (3 + list-length body) 8) 255, bit-and (3 + list-length body) 255] & body

Section: Message Builders

  mqttsn-build-connect : Integer, Integer, Text -> List Integer
  mqttsn-build-connect (flags) (duration) (client-id) =
   mqttsn-frame mqttsn-connect ([flags, mqttsn-protocol-id] & mqttsn-u16 duration & mqttsn-text-bytes client-id)

  mqttsn-build-register : Integer, Integer, Text -> List Integer
  mqttsn-build-register (topic-id) (msg-id) (topic-name) =
   mqttsn-frame mqttsn-register (mqttsn-u16 topic-id & mqttsn-u16 msg-id & mqttsn-text-bytes topic-name)

  mqttsn-build-publish : Integer, Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  mqttsn-build-publish (flags) (topic-id) (msg-id) (data) =
   mqttsn-frame mqttsn-publish ([flags] & mqttsn-u16 topic-id & mqttsn-u16 msg-id & data)

  mqttsn-build-subscribe : Integer, Integer, Text -> List Integer
  mqttsn-build-subscribe (flags) (msg-id) (topic-name) =
   mqttsn-frame mqttsn-subscribe ([flags] & mqttsn-u16 msg-id & mqttsn-text-bytes topic-name)

  mqttsn-build-pingreq : List Integer
  mqttsn-build-pingreq = mqttsn-frame mqttsn-pingreq []

  mqttsn-build-disconnect : List Integer
  mqttsn-build-disconnect = mqttsn-frame mqttsn-disconnect []
